I enter the café.
Jessy is inside.
Jessy is an experienced worker here.
I know her from coming here earlier.
Jessy welcomes me with a smile.
"Welcome Maya," she says.
Today is my first shift.
Jessy gives me a clean apron.
"Put this on," Jessy says.
I put on that apron.
"Maya is a software engineer, right?" she asks.
"Yes," I reply.
"Have you ever volunteered in a café before?" she asks.
"Or have you worked in a kitchen?"
"No, this is my first time," I say.
"I am learning to do this work," I add.
Jessy smiles again.
"Don't worry, you can learn everything quickly," she tells me.
